    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d511">

                <pb facs="0507" n="431" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg431"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 761.94/96</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Guthrie to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-30T12:00:00+09:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 30, 1916, noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am informed that the Privy Council yesterday approved Russo-Japanese convention
                    and that Foreign Office states that announcement will be made simultaneously at
                    Petrograd and Tokyo and that terms given by papers are incorrect.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guthrie</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
